{
  "name": "mock-studio-mcp",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Mock Studio 的 MCP Server —— 让 AI 看到页面实际发了哪些请求，并直接写 mock 规则",
  "keywords": [
    "mcp",
    "mock",
    "chrome-extension",
    "claude",
    "cursor",
    "ai-tools"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org",
    "access": "public"
  },
  "bin": {
    "mock-studio-mcp": "dist/bundle/mock-studio-mcp.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist/bundle"
  ],
  "//": [
    "npm 发布的是 dist/bundle 里的【零依赖单文件】，不是 tsc 的目录树产物。",
    "用户配置因此可以写成 npx -y mock-studio-mcp，没有任何本地路径。",
    "tsc 那套（dist/mcp-server/src）只保留给本仓库的 e2e 和类型检查用。"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json && node build-bundle.mjs",
    "bundle": "node build-bundle.mjs",
    "dev": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --watch",
    "start": "node dist/bundle/mock-studio-mcp.mjs",
    "install-clients": "node dist/bundle/mock-studio-mcp.mjs install",
    "e2e": "npm run build && node e2e.mjs",
    "prepublishOnly": "npm run build"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.12.0",
    "ws": "^8.18.0",
    "zod": "^3.23.8"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/ws": "^8.5.12",
    "esbuild": "^0.21.5"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  }
}
